<!--
  English strings. Apple copywriting rules applied:
   - "Your" perspective, not feature perspective
   - Verbs, not nouns ("Protect", "Restore", not "Protection", "Restoration")
   - No jargon ("Silenced", not "Screened out via heuristic rules")
   - No marketing superlatives ("Silenced", not "Perfectly silenced")
   - Brevity: the entire surface area of the app is 6 visible strings

  If a new string is proposed and it can't clear all five tests,
  the feature that needs it shouldn't ship.
-->
